胆寒了。“九，九夫人请息怒，连城峰这就去请魅主子来……”一向在王府中嚣张的管家连城峰满脸冷汗。不过最后一句却泄露了他歹毒心思。他以为叫来连城魅就一定会让眼前的凰冷月失态。毕竟这可是她不顾一切作践自己也要嫁的男人。可是他却没想到此时的凰冷月早就不是当初那个花痴懦弱的凰冷月了。凰冷月慵懒的靠在山石上，眸底闪过一丝冷意，“对！让他来啊，我正好要和他退婚！”退婚？！所有的人都倒吸一口冷气。这个废物脑子被驴踢了吧。惊魂未定的众家丁闻言，个个都低下头偷偷笑了起来，前些天这个废物不是还哭死闹活的非要嫁给魅主子吗，这会儿刚成亲受刺激了就要退婚？哼，她倒是把很傻很天真演绎的淋漓尽致！她以为这天下为她开？连城峰一怔，显然被凰冷月的话惊了。“是，小的这就传话给魅主子。”说罢，连城峰朝众家丁使了颜色。一众家丁抬起血肉模糊的两俱尸体便走。“好，本夫人就在这里等！”凰冷月优雅的捻起一朵玫瑰，坐定在山前石桌。脊背挺直，冷然，不畏一切！时间过去两个时辰，此时天气已接近中午。盛夏时分的太阳很毒辣，凰冷月等得有些不耐烦。之前有家丁来传，说连城魅两刻钟后会来，可这都两个时辰了！好，很好，到现在了还给她甩脸子，好的很！“咔嚓！”凰冷月手中的茶杯瞬时碎为粉末。而就在此刻，不远处绿树成荫处，一抹白色身影悠然出现。她的记忆告知她，来者正是连城魅。她抬头看去。连城魅凤眸黝黑的深不见底，棱角分明的脸带着些天生威严，鼻梁高挺，薄唇抿起一丝危险的弧度。飞眉入鬓，墨发三千悠悠披散在肩头，整张脸如同上天鬼斧神工的艺术品。谦谦君子，温润如玉。这是他给人的第一感。可她凰冷月是谁，两世为人，什么人她没见过？眼前的男人，虽俊美的天神共愤，却给人一种无形中的压迫感，那种潜在的危险感，比刀刃更凛冽。连城魅如天上的太阳，世人瞻仰爱慕还来不及，哪里受过一丝无视。他温润如春风的眸见了凰冷月竟是一凛。而此刻，凰冷月正一脸不屑，大眼一眨不眨的盯着连城魅。“你要退婚？”连城魅出口就笑了，这个女人竟用这眼神瞧他，难不成是昨夜守空房恼怒了？呵呵，女人真是麻烦，尤其是比废物还废物的女人。“对，我要退婚！”凰冷月也不含糊，优雅的站起身，一步一步走进连城魅。求收啊求收啊！", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/fengnitian-shashoukuangfei/5.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 5 I want to break off the engagement! \"Cang!\" The blade of the sword pierced the sycamore tree behind Lianchengfeng, grazing Lianchengfeng's ear exactly. If the sword's edge was deflected even further, his brain would burst. Fortunately, Lian Chengfeng dodged quickly, and fortunately Huang Lengyue had no murderous intention, so he barely escaped the sword. But this sword made Liancheng Feng tremble with fear. \"Nine, Madam Ninth, please calm down, Lian Chengfeng will go and invite Master Mei here...\" Lian Chengfeng, the butler who was always arrogant in the palace, had cold sweat on his face. But the last sentence revealed his vicious thoughts. He thought that calling Lian Chengmei would definitely make Huang Lengyue in front of him lose his temper. After all, this was the man she wanted to marry at all costs. But he didn't expect that Huang Lengyue at this time was no longer the nymphomaniac and cowardly Huang Lengyue. Huang Lengyue leaned lazily on the rock, with a cold look in her eyes, \"Yes! Let him come, I just want to break off the engagement with him!\" Break off the engagement? ! Everyone gasped. This piece of trash must have had his brain kicked by the donkey. When the shocked servants heard this, they all lowered their heads and laughed secretly. A few days ago, wasn't this good-for-nothing still crying and fussing about insisting on marrying Master Mei? Now that he was just getting married, he was so excited that he wanted to break off the engagement? Huh, she did a very good job of being silly and innocent! Does she think the world is open for her? Lian Chengfeng was startled, obviously shocked by Huang Lengyue's words. \"Yes, I will send a message to Master Mei right now.\" After saying that, Lian Chengfeng showed his signs to the servants. A group of servants picked up the two bloody corpses and left. \"Okay, I'll wait here, Madam!\" Huang Lengyue elegantly twirled a rose and sat down on the stone table in front of the mountain. Back straight, cold and fearless! Two hours have passed and the weather is approaching noon. The sun in midsummer was very scorching, and Huang Lengyue was impatient to wait. Previously, a servant came to say that Lian Cheng Mei would be here in two quarters of an hour, but it has already been two hours! Okay, great, now I'm still shaming her, that's great! \"Crack!\" The tea cup in Huang Lengyue's hand instantly shattered into powder. And at this moment, not far away in the shade of green trees, a white figure appeared leisurely. Her memory told her that the person who came was none other than Liancheng Mei. She looked up. Liancheng Meifeng's eyes were bottomless dark, her angular face had some natural majesty, her nose was high, and her thin lips pursed in a dangerous arc. With flying eyebrows on the temples and three thousand black hair hanging loosely on her shoulders, the whole face is like a work of art crafted by heaven. A humble gentleman, as gentle as jade. This is the first impression he gives people. But who is she, Huang Lengyue? She has been born in two lifetimes, who has she not seen before? Although the handsome man in front of him was angry with the gods, he still gave people an invisible sense of oppression. That sense of potential danger was sharper than the blade of a knife. Liancheng is as charming as the sun in the sky. It is too late for the world to admire and admire her, and there is no trace of neglect. His eyes, as gentle as the spring breeze, froze when he saw Huang Lengyue. At this moment, Huang Lengyue had a look of disdain on her face and stared at Liancheng Mei with her big eyes unblinking. \"You want to break off the engagement?\" Lian Chengmei said with a smile. This woman actually looked at him with this look. Could it be that she was angry at the empty house last night? Haha, women are really troublesome, especially women who are worse than trash. \"Yes, I want to break off the engagement!\" Huang Lengyue did not hesitate, stood up gracefully, and walked into Liancheng Mei step by step. Please accept it! Please accept it!", "title_en": "Chapter 5"}